<title>HONG KONG: Southern Glass 96 net 153 mln yuan.</title>
<headline>Southern Glass 96 net 153 mln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		    725.10	vs    716.68</p>
<p> Net Profit		  153.04	vs    134.67</p>
<p> Earnings per share	  0.32 yuan vs	0.41 yuan</p>
<p> Net assets per share	2.78 yuan vs	2.95 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: China Southern Glass Holdings Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The results were published in a notice released by the Shenzhen Stock Exchange after the market closed on Friday.</p>
<p>The results were based on Chinese accounting standards, a Southern Glass official said.</p>
<p>Southern Glass proposed to distribute 1.5-for-10 bonus issue and a cash dividend of 0.05 yuan per share based on 1996 net.</p>
</text>
